							</div>
							<p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
								Blazing-fast macOS disk space visualizer and conservative system cleaner in Rust &amp; Tauri.
							</p>
						</div>

						<div class="p-3 bg-code-bg border border-border rounded-lg font-mono text-xs text-text-dim space-y-1.5">
							<div class="flex justify-between">
								<span>Scan speed:</span>
								<span class="text-text font-medium">&lt; 12ms / 85k files</span>
							</div>
							<div class="flex justify-between">
								<span>Memory footprint:</span>
