									</svg>
									<span>&nearr;</span>
								</a>
							</div>
							<p class="text-xs text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
								Isolated, recoverable coding agent runtimes with container sandboxing and strict eBPF syscall filtering (4ms boot).
							</p>
						</div>
						<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 pt-2 border-t border-border font-mono text-xs">
							<span class="tag-pill">Containers</span>
							<span class="tag-pill">eBPF</span>
							<a class="ml-auto text-text-dim hover:text-text no-underline" href="/blog/series/agentrun/">
